flowchart TD
    START["startup / resume (Ch 44/45)"] --> FETCH["fetch version policy (remote config, Ch 41, cached)"]
    API["API call returns 426 Upgrade Required (Ch 16)"] --> STATE
    FETCH --> STATE{compare installed versionCode to policy}
    STATE -->|installed >= nudgeFloor| OK["up-to-date: no action"]
    STATE -->|recommendedFloor..latest| SOFT["soft update: dismissible nudge"]
    STATE -->|installed < minSupported| FORCED["forced upgrade: blocking gate"]
    SOFT --> FLEX["Play flexible update (background) OR store link"]
    FORCED --> IMMEDIATE["Play immediate update OR store link - always an escape"]
    IMMEDIATE --> UPDATED["updated -> re-read versionCode -> no loop"]
    FLEX --> UPDATED
    ENFORCE["server also rejects unsupported versions (Ch 16/23)"] -.-> API
